   "st": 2.4,
   "range_st": 6.782,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 6.684,
   "e": 9.199,
   "text": "And it changes everything.",
   "dur": 2.515,
   "voiced": 113,
   "sim": 0.804,
   "f0": 120.243,
   "st": -1.082,
   "range_st": 4.879,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 10.144,
   "e": 13.958,
   "text": "Go back to the Hebbian memory from chapter four:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.814,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 14.103,
   "e": 22.481,
   "text": "the matrix that stores associations by adding up outer products, value times key-transpose.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.378,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 23.106,
   "e": 25.638,
   "text": "We watched it drown in crosstalk.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.533,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 26.338,
   "e": 29.143,
   "text": "Now look closely at a Transformer.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.804,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 29.72,
   "e": 32.444,
   "text": "Strip the softmax out of attention,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.724,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 32.978,
   "e": 36.067,
   "text": "and something extraordinary is left behind.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.089,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 36.287,
   "e": 43.342,
   "text": "Every new token writes its value, times its key-transpose, into a running matrix.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.055,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 43.831,
   "e": 48.778,
   "text": "Every query reads from that matrix, by multiplication.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.947,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 49.717,
   "e": 51.8,
   "text": "That is Hebb's rule.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.084,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 52.02,
   "e": 52.965,
   "text": "Exactly.",
   "dur": 0.945,
   "voiced": 51,
   "sim": 0.621,
   "f0": 113.612,
   "st": -2.064,
   "range_st": 6.151,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 54.013,
   "e": 61.94,
   "text": "In 2021, Imanol Schlag, Kazuki Irie and J\u00fcrgen Schmidhuber proved it formally.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.927,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 62.16,
   "e": 66.058,
   "text": "Linear attention is a fast weight programmer:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.898,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 66.348,
   "e": 74.196,
   "text": "a slow network that learns, by gradient descent, to write fast synaptic weights while it is thinking.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.849,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 75.715,
   "e": 79.698,
   "text": "The idea is older than the Transformer itself.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.983,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 80.425,
   "e": 89.33,
   "text": "In 2016, Jimmy Ba and Geoffrey Hinton argued that brains have synapses that change faster than learning,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.905,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 89.754,
   "e": 91.903,
   "text": "but slower than thought,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.149,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 92.523,
   "e": 99.292,
   "text": "and that these fast weights are a neurally plausible way to attend to the recent past.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.769,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 100.203,
   "e": 104.436,
   "text": "So the Transformer never rejected Hebb.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.233,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 105.686,
   "e": 108.386,
   "text": "It moved Hebb out of the synapse...",
